+- **Storage:** `navigator.storage.persist()` requested at onboarding; UI warns when denied. Unlock auto-locks after 10 min idle and on `visibilitychange` to hidden for > 2 min (configurable). A warning with an option to stay unlocked appears 2 min before the idle lock (QV-13-REQ-007; QV-ADR-027 B3-11a: the 10 min default is accepted as compliant).
